    test_runner_drops_example_names_after_21_2026_11_10, 0, "bin/simple test shows only 21 of 36 example names for test/01_unit/compiler/mir/mir_lowering_new_spec.spl. Root cause: a failing expect(source).to_contain(..) formats the WHOLE actual value (a 300 KB compiler source) into the failure message, the child stream exceeds TEST_OUTPUT_CAPTURE_BYTES (4 MiB), and process_run_bounded keeps only head+tail, dropping the middle (and the example names/verdicts in it). SPEC FILE VERDICT still counts all examples."

