    test_runner_drops_example_names_after_21_2026_11_10, 0, "2026-11-11 fix-implemented-verification-pending (work/p2-mir-lowering-spec-drift-2): seed-side fix in push_bdd_failure (interpreter_call/bdd.rs): each recorded failure message is bounded to 2000 bytes (char-boundary safe) with a 'failure message truncated: N bytes omitted' note, so output stays far under the capture cap and every example name/verdict prints. Spec: Rust unit test huge_failure_message_is_bounded (300k-char message). This is Rust seed code: needs a seed redeploy to take effect in bin/simple; the pre-fix symptom was reproduced on the deployed binary (21 of 36 names). Verified green by cargo test on the seed; deployed-binary verification pending redeploy."
